OL,3,GNEWSADad's dream campervan became his
OL,4,A'worst nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat began as a dream come true ended
OL,7,Fas a dad's "worst nightmare" when his
OL,8,Fcampervan was returned 14 months after
OL,9,Fbreaking down in France.
OL,11,FMatt Collins, from Redditch, bought the
OL,12,Fvehicle for #7,000 last year and
OL,13,Fplanned to travel across Europe with
OL,14,Fhis family after spending time
OL,15,Frestoring it.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
