OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSADad's dream campervan became his
OL,4,A'worst nightmare'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut two days into the trip, the
OL,7,Fcampervan broke down in France and was
OL,8,Ftaken to a local garage after Collins
OL,9,Fcontacted the RAC. When it was finally
OL,10,Freturned to Worcestershire, he said it
OL,11,Fwas missing an engine and filled with
OL,12,Fmould.
OL,14,FThe RAC said the nearly 25-year-old
OL,15,Fcampervan suffered a serious engine
OL,16,Ffailure but accepted the situation
OL,17,Fshould have been managed more
OL,18,Fproactively by its partners.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
